{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IDataProtectionManager/IDataProtectionManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IDataProtectionManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IDataProtectionManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IDataProtectionManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.6.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">IDataProtectionManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">DataProtectionManager class is used to protect user data.</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"Copy package name\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"Description\" style=\"display: none;\">Description:</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">DataProtectionManager class is used to protect user data. In order to complete the function logic or report event tracking data, DJI MSDK will send user data to the DJI server in the background. You can agree or disagree with DJI MSDK to report user data through this manager. <br><br><b>Note: This manager only manage the user data reported by the DJI MSDK background, and does not manage the user data passed in by calling the interface.</b> <br><br><code><i>Supported since MSDK 5.6.0</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>Members</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">6</span> members</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"Filter by name, parameter or description\" aria-label=\"Filter members\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Clear search\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">Method</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Method</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">6</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"agreetoproductimprovement agree or disagree with the product improvement project.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">agreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Agree or disagree with the product improvement project.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"isagreetoproductimprovement gets whether to agree to the product improvement project.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isAgreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Gets whether to agree to the product improvement project.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"enablemsdklog enable or disable the msdk log storage.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">enableMSDKLog</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Enable or disable the MSDK log storage.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"ismsdklogenabled get whether the msdk log storage function is enabled.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isMSDKLogEnabled</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Get whether the MSDK log storage function is enabled.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getmsdklogpath get the storage path of the msdk.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getMSDKLogPath</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Get the storage path of the MSDK.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"clearmsdklog clear the msdk log.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">clearMSDKLog</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Clear the MSDK log.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement_inline\">agreeToProductImprovement</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>agreeToProductImprovement</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">agreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">isAgree</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Agree or disagree with the product improvement project. Through this project, DJI MSDK will collect DJI device UUID, mobile device UUID and diagnostic and usage data for user behavior analysis. This analysis helps DJI improve products and services. DJI will take necessary data protection measures before data analysis.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>isAgree</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true to ageree product improvement project.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<h4 id=\"Product-Improvement-Project\">Product Improvement Project</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement_inline\">isAgreeToProductImprovement</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isAgreeToProductImprovement</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isAgreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Gets whether to agree to the product improvement project.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">boolean</font></code></td><td>true if it is agreed to product improvement project.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<p><br></p>\n<h4 id=\"MSDK-Log\">MSDK Log</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog_inline\">enableMSDKLog</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>enableMSDKLog</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">enableMSDKLog</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">enabled</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Enable or disable the MSDK log storage. This function is enabled by default. You can get the log storage path through <code><a href=\"IDataProtectionManager.html#idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath\">getMSDKLogPath</a></code>. When a problem occurs with the MSDK, you can send this MSDK log to DJI for analysis and problem solving. When there are too many logs, you can call <code><a href=\"IDataProtectionManager.html#idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog\">clearMSDKLog</a></code> to clear the logs.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>enabled</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true means enabling the MSDK log storage function.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled_inline\">isMSDKLogEnabled</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isMSDKLogEnabled</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isMSDKLogEnabled</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Get whether the MSDK log storage function is enabled.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">boolean</font></code></td><td>true means enabling the MSDK log storage function.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath_inline\">getMSDKLogPath</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getMSDKLogPath</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getMSDKLogPath</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Get the storage path of the MSDK.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">String</font></code></td><td>Returns the storage path of the MSDK.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog_inline\">clearMSDKLog</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>clearMSDKLog</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">clearMSDKLog</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Clear the MSDK log.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">boolean</font></code></td><td>true indicates that the MSDK log was successfully cleared.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Class-Members\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">Member Index</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">Methods</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>agreeToProductImprovement</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>isAgreeToProductImprovement</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>enableMSDKLog</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled\"><sp